# durability: track the load-bearing verdict evidence in place (the rest of runs/ stays ignored).
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded, so re-include the dirs, re-exclude their
# contents, then re-include the specific curated files. See STUDIO_RUN_REPORT.md durability note.
!runs/
runs/*
# The method program's raw shard receipts are 1.9 MB of JSON and are what the independent scientific
# verifier recomputes from. Tracking them is what makes Role C reproducible from a clean clone.
!runs/method/
runs/method/*
!runs/method/mop-experimental-method-reformation-v1/
!runs/method/mop-experimental-method-reformation-v1/**
runs/method/mop-experimental-method-reformation-v1/coverage/
# The Substrate master program's verdict evidence. The experiment decisions carry the admission reports,
# the refusals with their blocking violations and the principal measurements, and the result ledger is
# what turns an item terminal. The independent recomputation reads them, so a clean clone needs them.
# test_ledger.json is deliberately NOT tracked: a clean clone must rerun the tests rather than inherit a
# claim that they passed.
!runs/substrate/
runs/substrate/*
!runs/substrate/mop-substrate-master-v1/
runs/substrate/mop-substrate-master-v1/*
!runs/substrate/mop-substrate-master-v1/result_ledger.json
!runs/substrate/mop-substrate-master-v1/experiments/
!runs/substrate/mop-substrate-master-v1/experiments/**
!runs/substrate/v1/
runs/substrate/v1/*
!runs/substrate/v1/result_ledger.json
!runs/substrate/v1/experiments/
!runs/substrate/v1/experiments/**

!runs/pre_studio/
runs/pre_studio/*
!runs/pre_studio/close_e7_sparse.json
!runs/pre_studio/close_ex5_local_rules.json
!runs/pre_studio/close_ex2_planning.json
!runs/pre_studio/close_b5_degeneracy.json
!runs/pre_studio/frozen_random_census.json
!runs/pre_studio/census_reaudit.json
!runs/pre_studio/RESULTS_PRE_STUDIO.md
!runs/mot/
runs/mot/*
!runs/mot/dr13_predictor_fidelity.json

# model weights and local AI go-prompt
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.bin
**/.DS_Store
GO.md

# Accretion Collapse scratch working area
.collapse/
